# crease: chords on the chord track (four voices), then six notes into them so the host steals and fades voices,
# then the bias at one end over a held chord.
tempo 90
steps 24
tail 4.0
track chord
preset 140 128 20 100 220 90 0 0 128 0 128 180 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 C3 8 100
note 0 G3 8 100
note 0 C4 8 100
note 0 E4 8 100
note 8 A2 8 110
note 8 E3 8 110
note 8 A3 8 110
note 8 C4 8 110
note 8 E4 8 110
note 8 A4 8 110
param p2 0 16
note 16 F3 8 90
note 16 A3 8 90
note 16 C4 8 90
note 16 F4 8 90
expect sound 0 24
expect idle 70
expect peak_below -2
